 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "Embross builds self-service systems for airlines and airports covering check-in, bag drop and transit. Its bag drop line, the VelocityBagDrop, is an automated self bag drop product built for flexibility and throughput.",
   "The V series kiosks are pitched at service providers that need flexibility across different environments. TravelStream is a biometric-based, automated passenger processing product. Project news lists airports deploying its Odyssey CUPPS platform and check-in systems.",
   "The company says more than 23,000 of its kiosks are deployed across airports and airlines. It claims some of the largest deployment footprints of airport kiosks in the world. Embross puts its own history at over 20 years of delivering passenger self service kiosks. Announcements include VelocityOnePIK kiosks deployed at Calgary Airport. Another records a contract signed with A\u00e9roport Marseille Provence. The company also announced an acquisition of Edge-Airport alongside passenger processing and airport management solutions."
  ],
